<title>POLAND: BPH FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 21.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>BPH FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 21.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					 21.82 vs   22.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   38.60 vs   38.88</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 57.01 vs   54.28</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	95.69 vs   71.04</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					 44.76 vs   55.49</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   76.16 vs   91.40</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		117.28 vs  112.11</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     190.08 vs  138.46</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank</p>
<p>Przemyslowo-Handlowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
